   "truncated": false,
   "text": "\r\n\r\nJennifer Coyle, Homer, AK.\nI am very opposed to a data center in Cook Inlet. It is extremely harmful to the delicate environment we have in Alaska. Many species could be harmed, including whales and salmon. It is not necessary to put a data center in Cook Inlet. Find somewhere else.\r\n\r\n"
  }
